>> title: Courgette and Mint Frittata
>> servings: 4
>> tags: lunch, vegetarian, quick
>> time: 30 minutes

Slice @courgette{3} into coins and fry in @olive oil{2%tbsp} in an #ovenproof pan{} for ~{8%minutes} until golden.

Beat @eggs{8} with @feta{100%g}, @mint{2%tbsp}, @salt{0.5%tsp} and @black pepper{0.5%tsp}.

Pour over the courgettes and cook gently for ~{6%minutes}.

Finish under a hot #grill{} for ~{4%minutes} until puffed and set.
